Subject: [PATCH 10/13] Add PartitionAlloc backend glue
 (--with-malloc-preload=partitionalloc)

Shim and preload TUs only.  Upstream sources come from the
partition_alloc tarball unpacked into malloc/partition_alloc/ in %prep.
